<div class="hdr">
  <h1>DSM-5-TR 解離症章節（Dissociative Disorders）系統性臨床大綱</h1>
  <p>Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders, Fifth Edition, Text Revision</p>
  <div class="nav">
    <a href="#intro">核心概述</a>
    <a href="#did">解離性身分疾患 (DID)</a>
    <a href="#da">解離性失憶症 (DA)</a>
    <a href="#ddd">去人格化/去現實化疾患 (DDD)</a>
    <a href="#osdd">其他特定/未特定解離疾患</a>
